        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10931297?u=600cfcb4c4e709dfbc66b328147d846ee87b1e51&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Just noticed I duplicated a note in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3848853651\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28900\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28900/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28900\">#28900</a> and <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Device_Memory_API#http.headers.Sec-CH-Device-Memory\" rel=\"nofollow\">it looks a little messy in MDN</a>:</p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10931297/580904043-478525e0-00dd-4489-9def-24b807552186.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..TW9fZlMV9iXaEPKtpvHJZcvvhO78AbFb1dhzd7enakc\"><img width=\"641\" height=\"497\" alt=\"screnshot of MDN datya\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10931297/580904043-478525e0-00dd-4489-9def-24b807552186.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..TW9fZlMV9iXaEPKtpvHJZcvvhO78AbFb1dhzd7enakc\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 497px;; aspect-ratio: 641 / 497; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px; display: block\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<p dir=\"auto\">63 is before 147 so no need for notes then.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">N/A</p>\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Clean up of data added by myself in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3848853651\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28900\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28900/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28900\">#28900</a></p>\n",
