        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286386?u=bc4894b945491e0834d2306dade7fef748ddf698&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Added <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;attr-name&gt;</code> accepts namespaces</li>\n<li>Added <code class=\"notranslate\">impl_url</code> for Chrome &amp; Safari</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Tested using these WPTs:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"http://wpt.live/css/css-values/attr-namespace-case-sensitivity.xhtml\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://wpt.live/css/css-values/attr-namespace-case-sensitivity.xhtml</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://wpt.live/css/css-values/attr-namespace-non-existing.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://wpt.live/css/css-values/attr-namespace-non-existing.html</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://wpt.live/css/css-values/attr-namespace-valid.xhtml\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://wpt.live/css/css-values/attr-namespace-valid.xhtml</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://wpt.live/css/css-values/attr-namespace-wildcard.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://wpt.live/css/css-values/attr-namespace-wildcard.html</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 dir=\"auto\">Passes With flag set <code class=\"notranslate\">layout.css.attr.enabled</code></h5>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Firefox Beta 150</li>\n<li>Firefox Developer Edition 150</li>\n<li>Firefox Nightly 151</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 dir=\"auto\">Fails</h5>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Firefox 149</li>\n<li>Chrome Canary 148</li>\n<li>Chrome Developer 148</li>\n<li>Chrome Beta 147</li>\n<li>Edge Canary 148</li>\n<li>Edge Dev 148</li>\n<li>Edge Beta 147</li>\n<li>Opera Developer 147</li>\n<li>Safari Technology Preview 240</li>\n<li>Safari 26.4</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43788\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/43788/hovercard\">Content PR</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43789\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/43789/hovercard\">FF release PR</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29482",
            "title": "Firefox 150 adds CSS namespaced attributes behind pref",
            "date_modified": "2026-04-21T09:51:43.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-04-14T15:52:27.000Z",
